baseline = "Not run: the explicit gate order forbids testing before complete implementation and permits verification only through hf-done after hf-build. The initial private gate ledger had no prior runs. No pre-change test failure is claimed."
wiring_request = "precompiles/distribution tests, owning domain 6 (fm-chain-modules): integrate the v640 historical CALL and current-route activation coverage from repair_m1261_test.go into the parent package when that path is authorized; this task exercises distribution.GetVersioned and the real EVM keeper dispatch from its scoped external Go test package."
